  "dek": "An eleven-point advance reshapes the top ten, while mikelou1 and guoqin gu enter gold and leave two challengers outside.",
  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Early edition\nItsu reaches seventh as ARC-2’s gold cutoff jumps\nAn eleven-point advance reshapes the top ten, while mikelou1 and guoqin gu enter gold and leave two challengers outside.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-18-morning-arc-2",
