  "headline": "Itsu reaches seventh as ARC-2’s gold cutoff jumps",
  "id": "2026-10-18-morning-arc-2",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-18T10:03:04Z",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "A top-ten breakthrough survives a counter-move",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-itsu-identity-0",
        "wire-2026-10-18-0359-arc-2-itsu-muggle-rises-to-sixth"
      ],
      "text": "Itsu’s ARC-AGI-2 entry has climbed from 14th to seventh in the overnight comparison, adding 11.11 points to reach 70.28. The entry, reported as Muggle by the overnight wire, is now named ｶﾎｳｼｭｳｾｲ and still lists the exact Kaggle account nisshokuitsuki. It briefly reached sixth, before ALbert RUehlman improved to 70.56 and reclaimed that position. The closing gap between them is just 0.28 points."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Improving is no guarantee of keeping gold",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-18-0359-arc-2-two-teams-enter-gold-places",
        "wire-2026-10-18-0558-arc-2-gold-cutoff-rises-again"
      ],
      "text": "The provisional gold cutoff has risen from 57.08 at the overnight baseline to 61.81 at 16th. mikelou1’s recorded score advance from 45.14 to 66.39 puts that entry 13th; guoqin gu’s move from 46.39 to 61.81 secures the final gold place. ARCward Intelligence improved to 58.33 but closes 17th, outside the band, while Kajetan Schweighofer is 18th at an unchanged 58.06. ARCward now needs another 3.48 points merely to match the current cutoff."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The leaders hold while the chase compresses",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-17-1957-arc-2-arcnights-enters-top-ten"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs remains first at 88.06, followed by Yi-Chia Chen at 83.89, rabbithole at 80.56 and nvbanana at 79.17. Their scores are unchanged in this comparison. Itsu’s advance shifts ARC Raiders to eighth, Majkel1337 to ninth and Arcnights to tenth without any of those three losing points. Arcnights’ earlier top-ten arrival was already in yesterday’s Late edition; the new overnight story is the pressure from another challenger moving above it."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Further down, a renamed entry keeps its gain",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-18-0202-arc-2-harp404-advances-to-forty-second"
      ],
      "text": "Flying Pandas closes 42nd at 41.67 after an 8.34-point overnight gain. It is the same team ID the wire reported as Harp404, so the name change does not create a second score improvement. NguyenThanhNhan reaches 45th at 41.25, up 8.47 points. These advances matter below the medal headline too: holding a score does not hold a place when the field around it improves."
    }
  ],
